The study measures Countrix's teams against CounterWatch's public 6v6
numbers, https://counterwatch.gg, whose terms grant personal,
noncommercial use. Its data stays in a private benchmark repository; this
one holds at most the study's results, which credit CounterWatch where
they name it.
